<main>
<section class="hero" id="home"><div class="hero-inner"><div class="eyebrow">Nigeria-inspired roleplay • Your world, your story</div><h1>Live the life.<span>Make your mark.</span></h1><p>Welcome to NAIJA REPUBLIC RP. Create your identity, build a career, discover the city, join an organisation and write your own story alongside a growing roleplay community.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn gold" href="/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">START PLAYING ↓</a><a class="btn ghost" href="#experience">DISCOVER THE GAME</a></div><div class="proof"><div><strong>CREATE</strong><small>Your character, your identity</small></div><div><strong>BUILD</strong><small>Work, business and ambition</small></div><div><strong>BELONG</strong><small>Find your people</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="live" id="live"><div class="wrap">
<div class="lv-stats"><div class="lv-stat"><div class="lv-on"><span class="lv-dot"></span>ONLINE NOW</div><div class="lv-num" id="lvNum">1</div><div class="lv-sub">Players from around the world</div></div>
<div class="lv-stat" id="comWrap" hidden><div class="lv-on">COMMUNITY</div><div class="lv-num" id="comNum">0</div><div class="lv-sub">Members across Discord, YouTube and TikTok</div></div></div>
<div class="lv-join"><a class="btn gold" href="https://discord.gg/jtUWmqxdrR" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">JOIN DISCORD</a><a class="btn" href="https://www.youtube.com/@NaijaRepublicrpofficial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">YOUTUBE</a><a class="btn" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@naija.republic.rp?_r=1&amp;_t=ZN-9B9UAavtjV8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TIKTOK</a></div>
<div class="lv-cd" id="cdWrap" hidden><div class="eyebrow">Game launch countdown</div>
<div class="cd" id="cd"><div><b id="cdD">--</b><small>Days</small></div><div><b id="cdH">--</b><small>Hours</small></div><div><b id="cdM">--</b><small>Minutes</small></div><div><b id="cdS">--</b><small>Seconds</small></div></div>
<p class="cs-note" id="cdMsg"></p></div></div></section>
<section id="experience"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">A city full of possibilities</div><h2>Choose how your story unfolds</h2></div><p>From your first day in the city to the reputation you build, every roleplay journey starts with a choice. Find your path and make it count.</p></div><div class="feature-grid">
<article class="feature"><div class="icon">♙</div><h3>Create Your Character</h3><p>Design your look, choose your identity and decide who you want to become.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">✦</div><h3>Jobs & Careers</h3><p>Find work, develop your skills and build a name through your everyday choices.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">⌖</div><h3>Explore the City</h3><p>Discover districts, businesses, landmarks, hangouts and new opportunities.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">♜</div><h3>Factions & Organisations</h3><p>Join a team, take responsibility and contribute to the city in your own way.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">♛</div><h3>Vehicles & Customisation</h3><p>Build your collection and express your style with vehicles and character looks.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">◎</div><h3>Community & Events</h3><p>Meet players, take part in activities and create stories worth remembering.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="showcase" id="city"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Explore the Republic</div><h2>Discover the city life</h2></div><p>Explore the places, vehicles and moments that make the Republic feel alive. Each image below has its own dedicated place in the experience.</p></div><div class="gallery">
<article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Waterfront promenade and marina"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Places to explore</small><h3>Waterfront District</h3><p>Take in the view and enjoy the city by the water.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Custom exotic sports car"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Automotive culture</small><h3>Exotic Vehicle Collection</h3><p>Make every arrival memorable with your own style.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="MOON lifestyle venue"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Nightlife & venues</small><h3>MOON Lifestyle</h3><p>A place to meet, socialise and enjoy the city.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Luxury residence and driveway"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Property & living</small><h3>Luxury Residences</h3><p>Make a home and enjoy the rewards of your journey.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Roleplay character holding a rose"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Personal expression</small><h3>Character Style</h3><p>Give your character a look that stands out.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Custom Acura at a seasonal event"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Community calendar</small><h3>Special Events</h3><p>Join themed events and show what you bring.</p></div></article><article class="tile"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Two roleplay characters at sunset"><div class="tile-copy"><small>Player connections</small><h3>Stories & Relationships</h3><p>Build friendships and memorable in-game moments.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="factions" id="factions"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Find your crew. Serve your city.</div><h2>Factions & organisations</h2></div><p>Every faction has a purpose, a culture and responsibilities. Choose the roleplay path that fits the story you want to tell.</p></div><div class="faction-grid"><article class="faction"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Roleplay public service and uniformed characters"><div class="faction-copy"><div class="tag">Public safety • Law enforcement</div><h3>Police Department</h3><p>Protect residents, respond to incidents and uphold the law across the Republic.</p></div></article><article class="faction"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Street roleplay character with vehicles"><div class="faction-copy"><div class="tag">Street culture • Underground stories</div><h3>Street Gangs</h3><p>Build your crew, establish your identity and create your own street storyline.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section id="news"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Official updates</div><h2>News</h2></div><p>Announcements, updates and events from the NAIJA REPUBLIC RP team.</p></div>
<div class="news-grid" id="newsList"></div>

</div></section>
<section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Your next chapter starts here</div><h2>Ready to enter the Republic?</h2><p>Download the game, create your character and begin building your story in NAIJA REPUBLIC RP.</p><a class="btn gold" href="/download" target="_blank" rel="noopener">START PLAYING — DOWNLOAD APK</a><div class="cta-note">Android game download • Opens when the launch countdown ends.</div></div></section>
