<div class="field"><label for="aMail">Email</label><input id="aMail" type="email" required maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="aPass">Password</label><input id="aPass" type="password" required minlength="8" maxlength="200" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="At least 8 characters"></div>
<div class="field" id="fConf"><label for="aConf">Confirm password</label><input id="aConf" type="password" maxlength="200" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="Type the password again"></div>
<button class="btn gold" type="submit" id="aGo" style="width:100%">CREATE ACCOUNT</button><div class="status" id="aMsg" role="status"></div></form></div>
<div id="acctIn" hidden><p>Signed in as <b id="aWho"></b></p><p class="cs-note" id="aRole"></p><p class="cs-note">Welcome to the Republic! You can close this window and keep exploring.</p><button class="btn" id="aOut" type="button" style="width:100%">LOG OUT</button></div></div>
</div><div class="panel" id="p-topup"><section class="shop" id="topup"><div class="wrap">
<div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Republic coins</div><h2>Buy coins</h2></div><p>Choose how many coins you want and place your order. We email you how to pay, and your coins are added in the game once we confirm your payment.</p></div>
<div class="cs-grid">
<div>
<h3 class="cs-st"><b>1</b>Choose your server</h3>
<div class="cs-srv" id="csServers" role="group" aria-label="Server"><button type="button" class="cs-pack" data-s="Server 01"><span class="n">Server 01</span><small>Tap to select</small></button><button type="button" class="cs-pack" data-s="Server 02"><span class="n">Server 02</span><small>Tap to select</small></button></div>
<h3 class="cs-st"><b>2</b>Choose your coins</h3>
<div class="cs-packs" id="csPacks" role="group" aria-label="Quick amounts"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="csAmt">Or enter any amount</label><input id="csAmt" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="100" max="500000" step="1" value="500"><div class="cs-note" id="csHint"></div></div>
<h3 class="cs-st"><b>3</b>Your details</h3>
<div class="cs-two"><div class="field"><label for="csPid">Character name</label><input id="csPid" autocomplete="off" maxlength="40" placeholder="Your character name in the game"></div><div class="field"><label for="csCur">Region</label><select id="csCur"></select></div></div>
<div class="field"><label for="csMail">Your email (we reply here)</label><input id="csMail" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="120" placeholder="you@example.com"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="csPm">Payment method</label><select id="csPm"></select></div>
</div>
<aside class="cs-side"><h3>Order summary</h3>
<dl><dt>Server</dt><dd id="csSServer">–</dd><dt>Coins</dt><dd id="csSCoins">–</dd><dt>Rate</dt><dd id="csSRate"></dd><dt>Character</dt><dd id="csSPlayer">–</dd><dt>Payment</dt><dd id="csSPay">–</dd><dt>Total</dt><dd id="csTotal" class="cs-big">–</dd><dt id="csEstT">Estimate</dt><dd id="csSEst">–</dd></dl>
<button class="btn gold" id="csPay" type="button" style="width:100%">Review order</button>
<div class="status" id="csMsg" role="status"></div>
<div class="cs-ob" id="csOrder" hidden><p class="cs-note">Order ID: <b id="csBId" style="color:var(--gold)"></b></p><p class="cs-lead">You're about to purchase <b id="csBCoins"></b> in-game coins on <b id="csBServer"></b> for <b id="csBName"></b> (<b id="csBTotal"></b>).</p>
<button class="btn gold" id="csSend" type="button" style="width:100%">PLACE ORDER</button><div class="status" id="csSendMsg" role="status"></div>
<p class="cs-lead" id="csDone" hidden></p>
<div id="csFallback" hidden><p>Send your order with Gmail instead. The message is already written, you only press Send.</p><a class="btn" id="csGmail" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="width:100%">Continue to Gmail →</a><p class="cs-note" style="margin-top:10px"><a id="csMailto" href="#" style="color:var(--gold)">Use your default mail app</a></p></div>
<p class="cs-note">We reply by email with how to pay and add your coins after we confirm payment. Only pay after you hear from our official email. We never ask for your game password. <a href="#" id="csUseGmail" style="color:var(--gold)">Prefer Gmail? Open a Gmail draft instead.</a></p></div>
<p class="cs-note">Prices in other currencies are estimates. We confirm the exact amount in our reply. No payment is taken on this page.</p>
</aside></div></div></section>
</div><div class="panel" id="p-recovery"><form class="form-card" id="recoveryForm"><h3 id="recovery">Account Recovery</h3><p>Can't access your account? Fill in what you can. Never share your password or verification codes.</p>
<div class="field"><label for="rDev">Device model *</label><input id="rDev" name="device" required placeholder="Example: Samsung Galaxy S23"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rLoc">Country and city when you registered the account *</label><input id="rLoc" name="location" required placeholder="For example: Nigeria, Lagos"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rDet">Describe the issue in detail *</label><textarea id="rDet" name="details" required placeholder="Describe the problem"></textarea></div>
<p class="cs-note">Provide as many account details as possible, or at least one character linked to the account.</p>
<div class="field"><label for="rChar">Character name *</label><input id="rChar" name="character" required placeholder="Enter character name"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rSrv">Server *</label><select id="rSrv" name="server" required><option value="">Select a server</option><option>Server 01</option><option>Server 02</option></select></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rMail">Email linked to the account</label><input id="rMail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="example@gmail.com"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rTg">Telegram linked to the account</label><input id="rTg" name="telegram" placeholder="@telegram"></div>
<div class="field"><label for="rCon">Contact details *</label><input id="rCon" name="contact" required placeholder="Email, phone or Telegram where we can reach you"></div>
<button class="btn" type="submit">SEND RECOVERY REQUEST</button><div class="status" id="recStatus" role="status"></div></form></div><div class="panel" id="p-partnership"><form class="form-card" id="partnerForm"><h3 id="partnership">Business Partnership</h3><p>Have a creator, brand, community or business proposal? Tell us how you would like to collaborate.</p><div class="field"><label for="partnerName">Your name / organisation</label><input id="partnerName" name="name" required placeholder="Name or organisation"></div><div class="field"><label for="partnerEmail">Contact email</label><input id="partnerEmail" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="partnerType">Partnership type</label><select id="partnerType" name="type" required><option value="">Choose partnership type</option><option>Content creator / influencer</option><option>Business / brand collaboration</option><option>Gaming community</option><option>Event sponsorship</option><option>Other proposal</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="partnerDetails">Your proposal</label><textarea id="partnerDetails" name="details" required placeholder="Tell us about your idea"></textarea></div><button class="btn" type="submit">SEND PARTNERSHIP ENQUIRY</button><div class="status" id="partnerStatus" role="status"></div></form></div><div class="panel" id="p-support"><form class="form-card" id="contactForm"><h3>General Support</h3><p>For technical issues, faction questions or general enquiries, contact the team here.</p><div class="field"><label for="contactName">Your name</label><input id="contactName" name="name" required placeholder="Your name"></div><div class="field"><label for="contactEmail">Your email</label><input id="contactEmail" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com"></div><div class="field"><label for="contactSubject">Request category</label><select id="contactSubject" name="subject" required><option value="">Choose a category</option><option>Technical support</option><option>Faction enquiry</option><option>Community information</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="contactDetails">Message</label><textarea id="contactDetails" name="details" required placeholder="How can we help?"></textarea></div><button class="btn" type="submit">SEND MESSAGE</button><div class="status" id="contactStatus" role="status"></div></form></div></div></div>

<footer><div class="wrap"><div class="foot-top"><div class="foot-brand"><a class="brand" href="#home"><img src="data:image/webp;base64," alt="Naija Republic tiger emblem"><span>NAIJA <span class="red">REPUBLIC RP</span></span></a><p>An immersive Nigerian-inspired roleplay experience. Create your character, build your career and shape your story in a living, player-driven city.</p><div class="socials"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@NaijaRepublicrpofficial" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="YouTube" title="YouTube"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/></svg></a><a href="https://www.tiktok.com/@naija.republic.rp?_r=1&amp;_t=ZN-9B9UAavtjV8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="TikTok" title="TikTok"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.525.02c1.31-.02 2.61-.01 3.91-.02.08 1.53.63 3.09 1.75 4.17 1.12 1.11 2.7 1.62 4.24 1.79v4.03c-1.44-.05-2.89-.35-4.2-.97-.57-.26-1.1-.59-1.62-.93-.01 2.92.01 5.84-.02 8.75-.08 1.4-.54 2.79-1.35 3.94-1.31 1.92-3.58 3.17-5.91 3.21-1.43.08-2.86-.31-4.08-1.03-2.02-1.19-3.44-3.37-3.65-5.71-.02-.5-.03-1-.01-1.49.18-1.9 1.12-3.72 2.58-4.96 1.66-1.44 3.98-2.13 6.15-1.72.02 1.48-.04 2.96-.04 4.44-.99-.32-2.15-.23-3.02.37-.63.41-1.11 1.04-1.36 1.75-.21.51-.15 1.07-.14 1.61.24 1.64 1.82 3.02 3.5 2.87 1.12-.01 2.19-.66 2.77-1.61.19-.33.4-.67.41-1.06.1-1.79.06-3.57.07-5.36.01-4.03-.01-8.05.02-12.07z"/></svg></a><a href="https://discord.gg/jtUWmqxdrR" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Discord" title="Discord"><svg viewBox="0 0 24